Creating a unicorn in TiKZ involves drawing a horse and adding a horn. Start with the horse's body using arcs and lines, then add the horn using a simple line or curve. You can use the following code as a starting point:

```latex
\documentclass{standalone}
\usepackage{tikz}
\begin{document}
\begin{tikzpicture}
    % Horse body
    \draw (0,0) arc (180:360:1cm and 0.5cm);
    \draw (2,0) arc (0:180:1cm and 0.5cm);
    % Horn
    \draw (1,2) -- (1,3);
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{document}
```

This code will draw a simple unicorn. You can add more details like the mane, tail, and legs to make it look more realistic.
